    "quote": "For any $T\\in \\mathbb{N}$, if $\\Gamma_t \\leq \\overline{\\Gamma}$ almost surely for each $t \\in \\{1,..,T\\}$, $$\\E \\left[{\\rm Regret}(T, \\pi^{\\rm TS})  \\right] \\leq  \\sqrt{\\overline{\\Gamma} H(\\alpha_1) T}.$$"
